OL,2,Vj5$CEMuseum of Teletext Art MUTA:      
OL,3,V*/%CC1979 FIRST EXCURSIONS IN TELETEXT 
OL,4,G    CIN NORWAY - some of the earliest  
OL,5,G    Csurviving examples of Teletext Art
OL,6,K    Cin the world                      
OL,7,GHistory: In 1979 teletext tests started
OL,8,Gin NRK (Norwegian TV). Arild Boman     
OL,9,Gleading MediaCulture university        
OL,10,Gprojects joined the tests with other   
OL,11,Gartists, including Petter Br|nn and    
OL,12,GMorten Juvet.                          
OL,13,K                                       
OL,14,GThese projects were exploring first    
OL,15,Ghuman contacts with new arriving       
OL,16,Gtechnologies like computers and video  
OL,17,Gfrom 1961; VR with Erkki Kurenniemi &  
OL,18,Gsatellite art experiments in the 70s.  
OL,19,K                                       
OL,20,GIn 1979 the teletext media were unknown
OL,21,Gto researchers & artists exploring     
OL,22,Gspecific teletext visuality.           
OL,23,F]D         Intro in Finnish s. 806 >>> 
