OL,6,K                                       
OL,7, "Teletext", said the press man and at  
OL,8,  first died a little. "Teletext", he   
OL,9,  repeated later, - relieved.           
OL,10,K                                       
OL,11, "T-e-l-e-t-e-x-t", said the researcher.
OL,12,G"I believe,teletext",said the preacher.
OL,13,K                                       
OL,14,G"Tele-graphic art", said the artist.   
OL,15,G"School at home", said the pedagogue.  
OL,16,G"New tv-game!", said the child.        
OL,17,K                                       
OL,18,G"Teletext - A new literary genre",     
OL,19,  may obviously be written in teletext. 
OL,20,K                                       
OL,21,G"Teletext?", said the politician -     
OL,22,  then he tried to answer why.          
OL,23,                       Ca. boman 1979   
