OL,4,BDO YOU WANT TO PLAY COMPUTER MUSIC?    
OL,5, The following page contains a teletext 
OL,6, version of a computer score ofFECUMENE 
OL,7, the first Norwegian church music work  
OL,8, 1969 also played in NRK-TV during the  
OL,9, first landing on the Moon 1969.        
OL,11, It is based on the opening of the      
OL,12, Bible: the creation.                   
OL,13,K                                       
OL,14, The letters are notes, numbers are     
OL,15, lengths (0 is pause). The colour of    
OL,16,Gnotes indicate the octave of the notes:
OL,17, green is a basic one that you choose,  
OL,18, and red is the octave above it. Such   
OL,19, playing teletext was tested in 1979.   
OL,21, Now you may try, too!                  
OL,22, Nice if you send us a recording of it: 
OL,23,Fmediaculture.projects@gmail.com        
