OL,2,BEXCURSIONS IN TELETEXT - RESULTS       
OL,3,BThe 1979 MediaCulture tests showed:    
OL,4,K                                       
OL,5, 1. Potentials of teletext provisions & 
OL,6,    functions beyond mainstream media   
OL,7,    info. The technology provided       
OL,8,    possibilities of visual and textual 
OL,9,K   art work.                           
OL,10,K                                       
OL,11, 2. The art works included in the NRK   
OL,12,    teletext tests were the first direct
OL,13,    national transmissions of electronic
OL,14,    visual art into people's homes in   
OL,15,    Norway.                             
OL,16,K                                       
OL,17, 3. The 1979 tests belong to the        
OL,18,    earliest documented research in     
OL,19,    teletext art.                       
OL,20,K                                       
OL,21, 4. The project showed possibilities    
OL,22,    of using teletext as tool/medium    
OL,23,K   in research and art communication.  
